  "note": "The vector-core golden of 8a91421a (FP8 KV, norm fold, R-ARITH) is on main; 27d30c15 adds the reciprocal saturation. Every line reference to 8a91421a in deployment_arithmetic_sources is unchanged in 27d30c15 except reciprocal() (235-245)."
